         <p>
            <gap reason="omitted"/><pb n="18b"/><lb n="18b3"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex41012025-05-0612-57-09" status="finalized">dang po ni gal te rig tshogs pas ldog pa'i ched du phung po lnga bstan nas | chags sdang <expan>la sogs</expan> pa'i don du phung po lnga mi ston pa la rgyu mtshan ci yod zhe na || 'di la <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:4291">brang ti</rs> na re nyong pa <expan>thms cad</expan> kyi rgyu 'jig
				<lb n="18b4"/> tshogs la lta ba yin la des de nyes che bas de bzlog pa'i don du phung po lnga bstan zhes zer ba ni ma yin te | </seg><gap reason="omitted"/><pb n="18b"/><lb n="18b6"/><seg type="shared" xml:id="ex41012025-11-0516-06-05" part="M" next="ex41012025-05-0612-55-06" status="reviewed">des na rang lan ni bdag lta'i gnyen por phung po bstan te gnyen po'i ngo skal du che ba'i phyir ro ||
				gzhan gyi ni ma yin te ngo skad du mi che ba'i phyir dang | rgyu bdag lta log na <expan>'bras bu</expan> sdug 3 mi ldog pa mi srid te ba ni bas de'i lci klan glan chad pa <expan>bzhin no</expan> || </seg>
				
				<pb n="18b"/><lb n="18b6"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex41012025-05-0612-55-06" status="finalized" part="M" next="ex41012025-11-0516-06-10">yang gal te bdag lta'i gnyen por de bas <lb n="18b7"/> ngo skal du che ba'i gang zag la bdag <expan>med</expan> par bsgoM pa zhes pa gzhan yod pa'i phyir ro zhe na | 
				'di la <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:4242">rog</rs> na re de ni <expan>nyon mong</expan> rnam sbyong °°° sa bon °°° spong pa'i gnyen po yin la | 'di ni spyod pa rnam sbyong de mngon 'gyur spong pa'i gnyen por bstan pa yin <expan>pas so</expan> zhes pa zhal 'tsham yang  sa bdun pa			
				<note type="gloss"><note type="editorial">Reading of the note tentative.</note>de lta bu °°° dbye °°°°°° zhugs pa'i phyir dang | 'di °°°°°° brjod pas bdag 1 su med par °°°°°° bstan °°°°°° || yang gal te °°°°°° log rtogs mi skye pa'i phyir de bstan pa don med do zhe °° | 'di la 'phags pa rnaMs log rtogs skye ba'i phyis pa rnaMs skye bo zhes zhal °°° yang</note>
				man chad du de skye par bshad de | byaMs pas <lb n="18b8"/> 
				<quote><lg><l>mtshan la rgyu dang phung po dang ||</l> <l>khaMs dang skye mched dag dang ni ||</l> <l>khaMs 3 pa la gnas dang chags</l></lg></quote> zhes gsung pa'i phyir ro ||</seg>
				
				<pb n="18b"/><seg type="shared" xml:id="ex41012025-11-0516-06-10" part="M" status="reviewed">des na tsa zhig bzlog pa don du rung po bye brag <expan>med</expan> par smos so || 
				
				2 pa ni phung po lnga bar la bdag du lta na de'i 'grel pa dang bye bshad las | 'jig rten na phal cher rnam par shes pas la ni bdag
	         <pb n="19a"/> <lb n="19a1"/> du 'dzin la ¦ lhag ma rnams la ni bdag gir 'dzin to zhes gsungs pa dang 'gal lo zhe na | </seg><gap reason="omitted"/></p>
         
